PLAN AKI\uc0\u350 I (2026-05-10):\
\
(1) BACKEND \'97 at\uc0\u305 f arama endpoint:\
    - GET /api/workshop/citation-search?project_id=\{id\}&query=\{text\}&lang=\{tr|en|id\}\
    - Ad\uc0\u305 mlar:\
      a) PostgreSQL full-text search:\
         tsvector(papers.title || ' ' || papers.abstract) @@ plainto_tsquery(query)\
      b) project_pool \uc0\u8745  (proje havuzu \'f6ncelikli)\
      c) ORDER BY ts_rank DESC, total_cites DESC LIMIT 20\
      d) Her paper i\'e7in fact_paper_id_card meta (author + year + venue + doi) JOIN\
      e) Sonu\'e7 bo\uc0\u351  ise synonym list: engine/dictionary/\{lang\}.json'dan synonym \u8594  tekrar dene\
    - Output: \{ papers[], synonyms_tried[], total_results \}\
\
(2) BACKEND \'97 at\uc0\u305 f do\u287 rulama endpoint (hal\'fcsinasyon kap\u305 s\u305 ):\
    - POST /api/workshop/citation-verify\
    - Body: \{ project_id, document_text, citation_style \}\
    - Ad\uc0\u305 mlar:\
      a) Regex ile at\uc0\u305 flar\u305  \'e7\u305 kar: '(Author(?:\\s+et al\\.?)?,?\\s+\\d\{4\})'\
      b) Her at\uc0\u305 f i\'e7in papers tablosunda fuzzy match (author + year):\
         WHERE LOWER(authors) LIKE '%author%' AND year = matched_year\
      c) Bulunamayanlar \uc0\u8594  'hallucinated' flag\
      d) Her c\'fcmle i\'e7in sentence-transformers cosine vs paper.title+abstract:\
         < 0.55 \uc0\u8594  'topic_mismatch' flag\
      e) C\'fcmlede iddia var + at\uc0\u305 f yok kontrol\'fc:\
         Gemini Flash 1 \'e7a\uc0\u287 r\u305  (t\'fcm metin batch): c\'fcmle ba\u351 \u305 na 'needs_citation' bool\
    - Output: \{ sentences: [\{ text, citations[], status: ok|hallucinated|topic_mismatch|needs_citation \}] \}\
\
(3) BACKEND \'97 stil d\'f6n\'fc\uc0\u351 t\'fcr\'fcc\'fc:\
    - GET /api/workshop/format-citation?paper_id=\{id\}&style=\{apa|vancouver|ieee|chicago|mla\}\
    - Ad\uc0\u305 mlar:\
      a) papers + dim_author + dim_venue JOIN\
      b) Per-stil template uygulama (engine/citation/\{style\}.py):\
         * APA: "Author, A. A., & Author, B. B. (Year). Title. Journal, Volume(Issue), Pages."\
         * Vancouver: "1. Author AA, Author BB. Title. Journal. Year;Volume(Issue):Pages."\
         * IEEE: "[1] A. A. Author and B. B. Author, 'Title,' Journal, vol. X, no. Y, pp. Z, Year."\
         * Chicago: "Author, First. Year. 'Title.' Journal Volume(Issue): Pages."\
         * MLA: "Author, First. 'Title.' Journal, vol. X, no. Y, Year, pp. Z-Z."\
      c) DOI link otomatik eklenir\
    - Output: \{ formatted_citation, bibtex_entry \}\
\
(4) BACKEND \'97 eski-yeni denge analizi:\
    - POST /api/workshop/citation-balance\
    - Body: \{ project_id, citation_paper_ids[] \}\
    - Ad\uc0\u305 mlar:\
      a) papers.year histogram\uc0\u305  (5-y\u305 l bin'leri)\
      b) Eski (>5y\uc0\u305 l) / yeni (<5y\u305 l) oran\
      c) E\uc0\u287 er eski oran > %70 \u8594  project_pool'dan son 5 y\u305 l\u305 n top-10 \'f6nerisi\
      d) E\uc0\u287 er yeni oran > %90 \u8594  "klasik temeller" listesi (en y\'fcksek total_cites + en eski 10 paper)\
    - Output: \{ distribution: \{old_pct, recent_pct\}, suggested_papers[], balance_advice \}\
\
(5) FRONTEND:\
    - Sol panel: arama kutusu + dil dropdown\
      * Arama sonucu Standart Yay\uc0\u305 n Kart\u305  (Daralt\u305 lm\u305 \u351 ) listesi + "+at\u305 f ekle" buton\
