    - Altta: y\uc0\u305 l histogram\u305  + eski-yeni denge \'f6nerisi paneli\
\
(6) ENGINE/DICTIONARY \'97 synonym destekleri (V1 zorunlu, k\'fc\'e7\'fck ek):\
